OL,3,A'Grief can colour memory': Palace
OL,4,Aresponds after Earl Spencer's claim in
OL,5,ADiana book
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Palace spokesperson said: "While we
OL,8,Fdo not comment on books as a matter of
OL,9,Fprinciple, His Majesty is mindful that
OL,10,Fthe pain of fraternal grief can cloud
OL,11,Freason, affect judgment and colour
OL,12,Fmemory in ways others do not recognise,
OL,13,Feven many years after such a loss."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
