OL,3,AEU chief backs plan for Canada to
OL,4,Abecome 'associate member'
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsisting it would not be a
OL,7,F"partnership against anyone else", Von
OL,8,Fder Leyen did not mention Donald Trump
OL,9,Fby name. Nevertheless the US president
OL,10,Fthreatened to cut trade with the
OL,11,FEuropean Union in response to the
OL,12,Fproposal.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
